      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxg56pvsvc2c",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "From The Lancet: in an urgent care setting, the advice of the obsolete Gemini 2.5 Pro & Gemini 2.5 Flash (without access to patient medical records) were rated of similar quality to doctors by other physicians. There was no safety issues spotted.\n\nModels have gotten significantly better since.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxg56pvsvc2c",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-09T04:28:56.881Z",
      "likes": 105,
      "replies": 3,
      "reposts": 16,
      "score": 6.5,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.1,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 41.9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxhfe5axps2o",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Randomized trials with GPT-4o: \"AI access raises test scores, and a smaller gain persists a week later. Gains remain for students who use AI as a tutor (“augmentation”) and fade for students who have AI write for them (“automation”)\"\n\nAcross all experiments, positive effects arxiv.org/abs/2607.08849",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxhfe5axps2o",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-09T16:27:48.323Z",
      "likes": 65,
      "replies": 3,
      "reposts": 12,
      "score": 6.3,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.9,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxd2yu3fnc2h",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Anyhow, I think we are now done with the last round of skeptical responses to AI after Navier-Stokes. Yes, AI is now capable of producing novel proofs to hard problems that have eluded us\n\nThe next line will be that this is only constrained to math because of RL training. I suspect not, we will see.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxd2yu3fnc2h",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-07T23:11:53.234Z",
      "likes": 100,
      "replies": 9,
      "reposts": 6,
      "score": 5.9,
